# Revisions to skip when running `git blame`.
#
# Enable locally (once):
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# This repo leans on `git blame` more than most: several of the traps in
# CLAUDE.md are only discoverable from the comment beside the code, and finding
# the incident that motivated one means finding the commit that added it. A
# whole-repo reformat would bury all of that under one line, so every
# formatting-only commit belongs here.

# Adopt Biome — formatter applied across the workspace. Formatting only; the
# behaviour changes from that session are in separate commits.
